WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.935 --> 00:00:03.303
Atchoo!

00:00:03.470 --> 00:00:05.305
COLD MEDICINE
FOR: HARUO YAGUCHI

00:00:07.269 --> 00:00:08.969
I finally got to stay home from school

00:00:09.169 --> 00:00:12.746
but the fever is ruining my hidden agenda!

00:00:13.880 --> 00:00:15.215
Mom...

00:00:16.116 --> 00:00:18.752
Mom, I'm suffering here!

00:00:18.985 --> 00:00:20.353
Bring me some water!

00:00:20.620 --> 00:00:23.690
Refill my ice pack!

00:00:24.124 --> 00:00:26.559
I want a hug--

00:00:26.626 --> 00:00:27.660
What!

00:00:27.727 --> 00:00:30.630
Ono! Why the heck are you
in my house?

00:00:30.997 --> 00:00:33.066
That's no way to greet her!

00:00:33.533 --> 00:00:37.871
Ono was on duty today
and brought you the handouts from school.

00:00:39.239 --> 00:00:40.273
Did you hear him?

00:00:40.540 --> 00:00:42.275
"I want a hug," he said.

00:00:42.342 --> 00:00:45.145
-Can you believe it at his age--
-Oh man, kill me now...

00:00:46.513 --> 00:00:50.917
With such a cute girl here for my Haruo,

00:00:51.284 --> 00:00:52.986
I've got to be hospitable!

00:00:53.720 --> 00:00:56.122
How about being hospitable to me...

00:00:56.689 --> 00:00:57.624
Oh, man...

00:00:57.924 --> 00:00:59.926
What cruel twist of fate is this?

00:01:00.260 --> 00:01:01.094
Huh?

00:01:01.294 --> 00:01:02.529
Ah, the handouts.

00:01:02.729 --> 00:01:05.532
The classroom visit?
No way I'm bringing her.

00:01:05.598 --> 00:01:08.435
What son would want to show
his parents his failures?

00:01:09.069 --> 00:01:12.405
She would gape in horror
at my math grades...

00:01:12.472 --> 00:01:13.306
SEE AN EYE DOCTOR

00:01:13.373 --> 00:01:15.775
It's like I'm getting scolded
for playing too many games.

00:01:16.376 --> 00:01:19.579
All you brought were depressing things.

00:01:20.447 --> 00:01:22.982
Not one thing to cheer me up.

00:01:25.318 --> 00:01:27.153
CHINA WARRIOR

00:01:27.821 --> 00:01:28.788
Anyway...

00:01:28.888 --> 00:01:31.391
if you don't need anything, just go home.

00:01:31.424 --> 00:01:32.625
Sorry to keep you waiting!

00:01:34.060 --> 00:01:37.564
It's Mama Haruo's special pancakes!
Just like in the manga comics!

00:01:42.202 --> 00:01:44.437
How cute. What a little doll.

00:01:44.504 --> 00:01:49.476
Come on, should you be giving a lady
something like that before dinner?

00:01:49.576 --> 00:01:51.711
Well, I'm going shopping.

00:01:51.978 --> 00:01:53.713
Don't do anything naughty!

00:01:53.780 --> 00:01:55.448
As if we would!

00:01:55.815 --> 00:01:58.351
Hey, Ono! Say something!

00:01:58.518 --> 00:02:00.920
Don't fall for my mom's weird tricks!

00:02:02.188 --> 00:02:04.524
Hey! What are you snooping for?

00:02:05.425 --> 00:02:06.926
This is so obvious!

00:02:09.629 --> 00:02:12.065
Ah! If you're going,
just leave already! Jeez!

00:02:12.132 --> 00:02:13.666
Right away!

00:02:16.102 --> 00:02:18.938
This is how she treats her feverish son?

00:02:19.239 --> 00:02:21.674
You should leave once you finish that.

00:02:21.975 --> 00:02:25.178
Why did my mom have to force her way in?

